,10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:13'),(380,14,143,1,'Insert keys 10, 20, 30, 40, 50 into an AVL tree showing all rotations. Explain LL, LR, RL, RR rotation cases with diagrams.','descriptive','CO3','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:13'),(381,14,144,2,'Apply Quick Sort on the array [64, 25, 12, 22, 11]. Trace all partitioning steps, compare its average and worst-case complexity with Merge Sort.','descriptive','CO4','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:13'),(382,14,144,2,'Perform BFS and DFS traversal on a given graph starting from vertex A. Identify connected components and detect cycles using DFS.','descriptive','CO4','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:13'),(383,14,145,2,'Explain the Boyer-Moore string matching algorithm. Trace the algorithm for pattern \"ABCABD\" in text \"AAABCABDABC\". Compute bad character table.','descriptive','CO5','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:13'),(384,14,145,2,'Construct a Standard Trie and Compressed Trie for the set of strings: {bear, bell, bid, bull, buy, sell, stock, stop}. Compare space efficiency of both structures.','descriptive','CO6','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:13'),(385,21,161,1,'Design a Java class BankAccount with attributes accountNumber, balance, and methods deposit, withdraw, getBalance. Use constructor overloading and access specifiers to enforce encapsulation.','descriptive','CO1','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(386,21,161,1,'Write a Java program demonstrating method overloading to compute area of circle, rectangle, and triangle. Explain compile-time polymorphism vs runtime polymorphism.','descriptive','CO1','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(387,21,162,1,'Design a Java hierarchy: Shape -> Circle, Rectangle, Triangle using inheritance. Override the area() method in each subclass and use an interface Printable for formatted output.','descriptive','CO2','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(388,21,162,1,'Create a Java package geometry containing classes for 2D and 3D shapes. Demonstrate package import, access control, and use of interfaces to enforce common behaviors.','descriptive','CO2','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(389,21,163,1,'Implement a producer-consumer problem in Java using threads and synchronized blocks. Use wait() and notify() for inter-thread communication with a bounded buffer.','descriptive','CO3','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(390,21,163,1,'Write a Java program to create three threads: printing odd numbers, even numbers, and Fibonacci series simultaneously. Use thread priorities and join() to control execution order.','descriptive','CO3','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(391,21,164,2,'Create a custom exception InsufficientFundsException in Java. Use it in a banking application to handle invalid withdrawals. Explain checked vs unchecked exceptions.','descriptive','CO4','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(392,21,164,2,'Write a Java program demonstrating the complete thread lifecycle. Show thread states: NEW, RUNNABLE, BLOCKED, WAITING, TIMED_WAITING, TERMINATED with code examples.','descriptive','CO4','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(393,21,165,2,'Design a Java AWT application for a simple student form with text fields, combo box for branch selection, and radio buttons for gender. Handle button click to display entered data.','descriptive','CO5','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(394,21,165,2,'Write a Java program to use ArrayList and HashMap from the collection framework to manage an inventory. Demonstrate add, search, update, and delete operations with iterators.','descriptive','CO6','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:50:46'),(395,545,1306,1,'Compare OSI and TCP/IP reference models. Explain the function of each layer in OSI model and map them to TCP/IP layers. Describe how data encapsulation and decapsulation occur during transmission.','descriptive','CO1','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(396,545,1306,1,'Classify computer networks by scale (PAN, LAN, MAN, WAN) and topology (bus, star, ring, mesh). Explain transmission media: twisted pair, coaxial cable, fiber optic, and wireless, with bandwidth and distance characteristics.','descriptive','CO1','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(397,545,1307,1,'Explain framing techniques in data link layer: character count, byte stuffing, and bit stuffing. Apply bit stuffing to the data string 011011011101111 using HDLC flag 01111110.','descriptive','CO2','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(398,545,1307,1,'Explain CRC error detection. Compute CRC for message 110101011 using generator polynomial 1011. Verify at receiver side. Compare CRC with checksum and parity bit methods.','descriptive','CO2','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(399,545,1308,1,'Explain IPv4 addressing and subnetting. A company has network 192.168.1.0/24. Subnet it to create 6 subnets. Find the subnet mask, network address, broadcast address, and host range for each subnet.','descriptive','CO3','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(400,545,1308,2,'Explain the differences between distance vector routing (RIP) and link state routing (OSPF). Apply Dijkstra\'s algorithm to find shortest paths in a given network topology from source router A.','descriptive','CO3','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(401,545,1309,2,'Compare TCP and UDP in terms of connection establishment, reliability, flow control, congestion control, and applications. Explain TCP three-way handshake and four-way termination with sequence/acknowledgment numbers.','descriptive','CO4','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(402,545,1309,2,'Explain TCP flow control using sliding window protocol and congestion control using slow start, congestion avoidance, and fast retransmit/recovery mechanisms. Trace the congestion window evolution over time.','descriptive','CO4','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(403,545,1310,2,'Explain the DNS resolution process step by step for the URL \"www.example.com\". Describe recursive and iterative queries, root servers, TLD servers, and authoritative name servers.','descriptive','CO5','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(404,545,1310,2,'Explain symmetric and asymmetric encryption with examples (AES, RSA). Describe digital signatures, digital certificates, and SSL/TLS handshake protocol for secure web communication.','descriptive','CO6','Analyze',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:51:57'),(405,555,1346,1,'Explain Python\'s standard data types with examples: numbers, strings, lists, tuples, sets, and dictionaries. Write a program to demonstrate mutable vs immutable types and show key operations on each.','descriptive','CO1','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(406,555,1346,1,'Explain Python operators: arithmetic, relational, logical, bitwise, assignment, and identity operators with examples. Write a program to demonstrate operator precedence with a complex expression.','descriptive','CO1','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(407,555,1347,1,'Write a Python program to implement linear search and binary search on a list. Compare the time complexity of both algorithms. Use list comprehension to filter elements greater than the mean.','descriptive','CO2','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(408,555,1347,1,'Explain lambda functions, map(), filter(), and reduce() in Python with examples. Write a program using these functions to process a list of student marks: compute pass percentage, filter distinctions, and find highest mark.','descriptive','CO2','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(409,555,1348,1,'Design a Python class hierarchy for a banking system: Account -> SavingsAccount, CurrentAccount. Implement deposit, withdraw, and calculate_interest methods. Demonstrate polymorphism and method overriding.','descriptive','CO3','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(410,555,1348,2,'Explain abstract classes and interfaces in Python using ABC module. Implement a Shape abstract class with area() and perimeter() abstract methods. Create Circle and Rectangle subclasses and demonstrate duck typing.','descriptive','CO3','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(411,555,1349,2,'Write a Python program to read a CSV file containing student records, handle FileNotFoundError and ValueError exceptions, and write students with CGPA > 8.0 to a new file. Use try-except-finally blocks.','descriptive','CO4','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(412,555,1349,2,'Explain Python\'s exception handling mechanism. Create custom exceptions for a library management system. Demonstrate raise, except, else, and finally clauses in a book issue/return workflow.','descriptive','CO4','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(413,555,1350,2,'Write a Python program using NumPy to: create a 3x3 matrix, compute its determinant and inverse, multiply two matrices, and find eigenvalues. Compare execution speed with pure Python implementation.','descriptive','CO5','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46'),(414,555,1350,2,'Use Pandas to analyze a given dataset of student marks: load CSV, handle missing values, compute descriptive statistics, group by branch, and plot a bar chart of average marks using Matplotlib.','descriptive','CO6','Apply',10,1,0,0,'2026-07-11 08:52:46');
