192,79,'fib','An M-derived filter introduces a tuning parameter labeled ______, which ranges numerically between 0 and 1.',NULL,'m','Remember',1,0,'2026-07-09 09:23:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(10563,192,79,'fib','An attenuator pad reduces signal strength by dissipating excess electrical energy as structural ______ power.',NULL,'thermal','Understand',1,0,'2026-07-09 09:23:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(10564,192,79,'fib','A ______ section filter gets its explicit name due to its structural resemblance to the Greek letter $\\pi$.',NULL,'pi','Remember',1,0,'2026-07-09 09:23:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(10565,192,79,'fib','Asymmetrical attenuators are primarily chosen when a designer needs to connect two modules with ______ impedances.',NULL,'unequal','Understand',1,0,'2026-07-09 09:23:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(10566,192,79,'fib','Filters constructed using only passive $L$ and $C$ elements are ideally assumed to have zero power loss within their designated ______-band.',NULL,'pass','Understand',1,0,'2026-07-09 09:23:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(10567,192,79,'fib','An equalizer designed with a cross-arm balanced structure is categorized as a symmetrical ______ network.',NULL,'lattice','Remember',1,0,'2026-07-09 09:23:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(10568,192,80,'mcq','Which condition is a fundamental mathematical requirement for a polynomial $P(s)$ to be categorized as a Hurwitz Polynomial?',NULL,NULL,'Remember',1,0,'2026-07-09 09:23:14','All its roots must lie strictly in the left-half of the complex $S$-plane','It must contain only even powers of the frequency variable $s$','Its coefficients must alternate systematically between positive and negative values','It must possess multiple roots located on the positive real axis line','A',0),(10569,192,80,'mcq','A driving-point impedance function $Z(s)$ can be successfully synthesized as a physical network only if it satisfies being a?',NULL,NULL,'Remember',1,0,'2026-07-09 09:23:14','Positive Real Func