part_label\": \"a\", \"part_order\": 1, \"bloom_level\": \"Apply\", \"question_text\": \"Describe how the OMA Lightweight M2M (LwM2M) protocol manages constrained resource devices.\"}, {\"marks\": 5, \"part_label\": \"b\", \"part_order\": 2, \"bloom_level\": \"Understand\", \"question_text\": \"Explain security vulnerabilities and counter-mechanisms implemented at the MAC 802.15.4 layer.\"}], \"difficulty\": \"Medium\", \"question_type\": \"Compound\"}','(manually entered via bulk-add)',NULL,'approved','2026-07-03 19:25:52'),(10866,222,820,'group','{\"parts\": [{\"marks\": 5, \"part_label\": \"a\", \"part_order\": 1, \"bloom_level\": \"Understand\", \"question_text\": \"Discuss routing-security challenges in the RPL protocol and how to safeguard against rank attacks.\"}, {\"marks\": 5, \"part_label\": \"b\", \"part_order\": 2, \"bloom_level\": \"Apply\", \"question_text\": \"Explain the integration requirements for securing a full end-to-end 6LoWPAN transmission path.\"}], \"difficulty\": \"Hard\", \"question_type\": \"Compound\"}','(manually entered via bulk-add)',NULL,'approved','2026-07-03 19:25:52');
